{%- comment -%}
  The piece whose photograph stands for a group on the home page: a category tile
  (sections/shop-categories) or a house tile (sections/houses). Outputs its handle; capture it.

  First a piece still for sale or coming soon that is not in avoid, then any piece not in avoid,
  then any piece at all. A piece tagged photo-to-come shares its photograph with another listing,
  so it is only the last resort.
  Params: list (products, default every piece), tag (only pieces with this tag),
  avoid (",handle,handle," of pieces already on the page).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign ps = list | default: collections.all.products
  assign pick = nil
  assign other = nil
  assign spare = nil
  for p in ps
    if tag != blank
      unless p.tags contains tag
        continue
      endunless
    endif
    assign key = ',' | append: p.handle | append: ','
    unless avoid contains key or p.tags contains 'photo-to-come'
      if pick == nil and p.available or pick == nil and p.tags contains 'coming-soon'
        assign pick = p
      endif
      if other == nil
        assign other = p
      endif
    endunless
    if spare == nil
      assign spare = p
    endif
  endfor
  if pick == nil
    assign pick = other | default: spare
  endif
  echo pick.handle
-%}
